39
00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:22.720
Ja.

40
00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.850
Ja Tõnu Karkukategi proovi.

41
00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:26.870
Teine.

42
00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.660
Me tegime proove teistega selleks,
